<div class="page-head">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Documentation · Game Studio</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Build, test and publish 2D/3D games</h1>
    <p class="lede">Game Studio is a real editor over two independent runtimes: Canvas2D + Matter.js for 2D, Three.js + Cannon-es for 3D. Play mode, exported HTML and published games run exactly the same runtime.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/create?kind=game"><i data-lucide="gamepad-2"></i>New game</a>
    <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/docs/flow"><i data-lucide="workflow"></i>Discord bot docs</a>
  </div>
</div>

